1
00:00:00,052 --> 00:00:01,784
An army of vanaras

2
00:00:01,784 --> 00:00:03,607
was building Ram Setu,

3
00:00:03,607 --> 00:00:05,867
boulder by boulder.

4
00:00:05,867 --> 00:00:06,682
At the edge

5
00:00:06,682 --> 00:00:07,767
of the shore,

6
00:00:07,767 --> 00:00:09,507
a tiny squirrel carried one

7
00:00:09,507 --> 00:00:11,767
pebble at a time.

8
00:00:11,767 --> 00:00:13,867
The others laughed.

9
00:00:13,867 --> 00:00:15,497
What difference could something

10
00:00:15,497 --> 00:00:17,500
so small make?

11
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:18,361
But Rama saw

12
00:00:18,361 --> 00:00:20,267
what they missed.

13
00:00:20,267 --> 00:00:22,111
The squirrel kept showing up,

14
00:00:22,111 --> 00:00:23,833
whether the tide was calm

15
00:00:23,833 --> 00:00:25,400
or rough.

16
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:27,177
And with every return,

17
00:00:27,177 --> 00:00:29,700
another gap was filled.

18
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:30,940
Investing can work

19
00:00:30,940 --> 00:00:32,767
the same way.

20
00:00:32,767 --> 00:00:34,000
You do not need to

21
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:37,200
predict the perfect market moment.

22
00:00:37,200 --> 00:00:38,791
A SIP lets you invest

23
00:00:38,791 --> 00:00:40,933
the same amount regularly,

24
00:00:40,933 --> 00:00:43,400
through the ups and downs.

25
00:00:43,400 --> 00:00:46,369
Small steps, repeated consistently,

26
00:00:46,369 --> 00:00:48,867
can build something bigger.
